<title>JAPAN: Toho Zinc - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toho Zinc - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.65		vs	   22.01</p>
<p> Operating	    1.83		vs	  487    million</p>
<p> Current		1.41		vs	  278    million</p>
<p> Net		  564    million    vs	    6    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.83 yen	  vs	    0.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    117 million	  vs	 108 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Toho Zinc Co Ltd is a nonferrous custom smelter specialising in zinc and lead.</p>
